---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE_DATA } from '../constants';
import portraitImage from '../assets/portrait.png';

import '../styles/about.css';
---

<Layout pageTitle="About">
    <div class="page-container">
        <h1>About me</h1>

        <div class="about-content">
            <div class="about-intro-wrapper centered-column">
                <div class="about-header centered-column">
                    <Image src={portraitImage} alt={SITE_DATA.name} class="about-portrait" />
                    <h2 class="about-name">{SITE_DATA.name}</h2>
                </div>

                <p class="intro-text">
                    I am a lifelong learner and insurance industry professional, and I believe there has never
                    been a more exciting time to learn than now. We are living in the age of Agentic AI, which
                    can make everyone much more productive, both personally and in business. I believe every
                    knowledge worker should develop a sound understanding of large language models, how they work,
                    and what their capabilities and limitations are, and a basic understanding of the CLI and modern development tools. 
                </p>
                <br>
            </div>
            <section>
                <h2>Positions</h2>
                
                            <h3>Currently: Senior Consultant Data and Analytics</h3>
                            <p>Details and positions history is available on <a href={`https://linkedin.com/in/${SITE_DATA.linkedin}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>.</p>
                    
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2>Education</h2>
                <ul class="education-list icon-list">
                    <li>
                        <div class="education-entry">
                            <h3>MBA – Master of Business Administration (E-Business)</h3>
                            <p class="institution">PFH - Private University of Applied Sciences and Arts, Göttingen, 2016</p>
                            <p class="grade">Thesis: "Part-Time Entrepreneurship in E-Commerce: Reducing Risks through the Use of External Services – A
                               Case Study of a Made-to-Measure Shirt Provider"</p>
                        </div>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <div class="education-entry">
                            <h3>MEng – Master of Engineering (Renewable Energies)</h3>
                            <p class="institution">University of Applied Sciences and Arts, Hannover, 2012</p>
                            <p class="grade">Opportunities and Risks in China's Reinsurance Industry amid Increasing Concentration of Insured Values</p>
                        </div>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <div class="education-entry">
                            <h3>BSc – Bachelor of Science in Business Administration (Banking and Insurance)</h3>
                            <p class="institution">University of Applied Sciences and Arts, Hannover, 2009</p>
                            <p class="grade">The Impact of the German Accounting Law "Bilanzrechtsmodernisierungsgesetz"
                            (BilMoG) on the Financial Reporting of a Medium-Sized Industrial Company.</p>
                        </div>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </section>
            
            <section>
                <h2>Contact</h2>
                <p>
                    The best way to get in touch is via <a href={`https://linkedin.com/in/${SITE_DATA.linkedin}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>.
                </p>
            </section>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>
